/* 订阅登录导入：每行三个厂商磁贴，网格占满弹窗高度；右侧留白 26px 让滚动条离磁贴远一些；
   磁贴不超过 9 个时滚动条不显示，滚到底部留 10px 空白。不可用（未登录 / 已收录）置灰 */
.import-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 68px); gap: 15px 17px; align-content: start; justify-content: center; height: 100%; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8px 26px 12px 8px; overflow-y: auto; overflow-x: hidden; scrollbar-width: thin; }
.import-tile { width: 68px; height: 68px; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; background: var(--surface-2); cursor: pointer; touch-action: none; user-select: none; transition: transform .12s ease-out, border-color .12s ease-out, box-shadow .12s ease-out, filter .12s ease-out, opacity .12s ease-out; }
.import-tile .provider-logo { width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: 11px; font-size: 16px; pointer-events: none; }
